  "notes": "Official cause code is TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields; narrative gives a specific proximate cause (RL16 relay failure) but no formal cause code/category was assigned, so cause node is marked provisional per rule 4. Reported initially under 10 CFR 50.72(b)(3)(v)(D) but later revised to remove that criterion since it was not judged to prevent fulfillment of a safety function; only 10 CFR 50.73(a)(2)(iv)(A) is the final Block 13 basis, though 50.72 notifications are referenced as regulatory references for completeness. No backup systems were stated as operable substitutes for the bypass system itself; Main Steam System was used post-scram for decay heat removal via manual operation, modeled as mitigation rather than BACKED_UP_BY since it is not a backup to a failed system in the ECCS sense. No previous occurrences reported, so no SIMILAR_TO edge or stub LER created."
